# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# block.part -- A machined block with two holes for M3 taps, for drawings
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# A block 50 by 30 by 20 with the edges of its top round by 2, and two
# tap drills of 2.5 down into it from the top: one 15 deep, blind, and
# one through.
profile p along z 0 0 0 50 0 0 50 30 0 0 30 0
extrude blk from 0 to 20 p
circle t1 2.5 10 15 along z
circle t2 2.5 40 15 along z
extrude h1 from 5 to 21 t1
extrude h2 from -1 to 21 t2
subtract block blk h1 h2
round 2 blk.end blk.side
